{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42544","headline":"留侯受南唐节度使知郡事辟予爲属以诗谢之 · 詹敦仁","name":"留侯受南唐节度使知郡事辟予爲属以诗谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晋江江畔趁春风，耕破云山几万重。\n两足一犂无外事，使君何啻五侯封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}